        "content": "## Try these examples\n\nUse the chat at the bottom of the workflow.\n\n**Agent examples**\n- `agent: Tell me about the history of n8n`\n- `agent: Find information about Node.js`\n\n**Chain examples**\n- `chain: Explain what an API is`\n- `chain: Compare REST and GraphQL`\n\nThe agent can decide to use the Wikipedia tool. The chain simply generates a response from the model.",
